29
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">mou ikkai</font></font></font></b></font>

30
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what's up, Temari?</font>

32
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's close. He's just right there.</font>

33
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! What should we do?</font>

34
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me.</font>

35
00:02:29,290 --> 00:02:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close.</font>

36
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that noise?</font>

37
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An explosion...
Perhaps it was a trap set for Sasuke.</font>

38
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he's okay.</font>

39
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:50,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry...
He wouldn't get bumped off so easily.</font>

40
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I sure hope so.</font>

41
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, shall we get started?</font>

42
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before that, I must have you both
return to your original forms.</font>

43
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please prepare yourself,
Sarutobi-sensei.</font>

44
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:23,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Absolutely</font>

45
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:23,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Incomparable!</font>

46
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:23,260
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A "Hokage" Level Battle</font>

47
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:08,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With every moment,
they are looking more lively...</font>

48
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that... Jutsu?</font>

49
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reanimation.</font>

50
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:18,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Forbidden Summoning Jutsu
that can bring the dead back to this world.</font>

51
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The cost of a regular Summoning Jutsu
is that it uses the blood of the caster.</font>

52
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I've heard that with this Jutsu,</font>

53
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:30,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to summon
a dead soul to this world...</font>

54
00:04:30,790 --> 00:04:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the body of a living person is sacrificed
as a container for the soul.</font>

55
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:41,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, the bodies of those two
are of the sacrificed...</font>

56
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

57
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps dust and dirt cover
the sacrificial body</font>

58
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:52,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and take on the original form
of the summoned soul.</font>

59
00:04:52,850 --> 00:04:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And by way of the charm
embedded in the head,</font>

60
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the personality of the soul is killed</font>

61
00:04:59,230 --> 00:05:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it morphs into no more
than a killing puppet.</font>

62
00:05:04,990 --> 00:05:06,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're complete.</font>

63
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They look like how they used
to look more than ever.</font>

64
00:05:12,410 --> 00:05:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know the joy and sense
of accomplishment</font>

65
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of hurting one whom
you once called Sensei?</font>

66
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I prepared this scenario
so that you might know that joy.</font>

67
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So please enjoy it.</font>

68
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

69
00:05:55,370 --> 00:05:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the shape and form
are the same...</font>

70
00:05:57,620 --> 00:06:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're neither the First Hokage
nor the Second!</font>

71
00:06:03,210 --> 00:06:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... know!</font>

72
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

73
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Dragon Flame Bombs.</font>

74
00:06:51,090 --> 00:06:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style: Water Wall.</font>

75
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

76
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be able to set into motion that level
of Water Style in a place with no water.</font>

77
00:07:06,940 --> 00:07:07,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe it.</font>

78
00:07:15,490 --> 00:07:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True to the title of the previous Hokage.</font>

79
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:24,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style: Water Shock Wave!</font>

80
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:37,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style: Mud Wall.</font>

81
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same mighty strength as always.</font>

82
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:59,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having two of you is quite a challenge,
as might be expected...</font>

83
00:09:41,350 --> 00:09:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.</font>

84
00:09:42,850 --> 00:09:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a Hidden Jutsu of the First Hokage.</font>

85
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Wood Style Jutsu:</font>

86
00:09:54,650 --> 00:09:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Deep Forest Emergence.</font>

87
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His Chakra became a source for life.</font>

88
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow... So this is the legendary
Wood Style Ninjutsu of the First Hokage</font>

89
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who brought turbulent times under control
and built the Leaf Village.</font>

90
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're finally caught... eh, Sensei.</font>

91
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Everyone's here, right?</font>

92
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay everyone, let's evacuate quickly.</font>

93
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't rush and don't panic!</font>

94
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Konohamaru-chan?</font>

95
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does your stomach hurt or something?</font>

96
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... it's not that.</font>

97
00:11:52,060 --> 00:11:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Summoning Jutsu.</font>

98
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Appear!</font>

99
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Monkey King Enma.</font>

100
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph...
Something pesky has appeared, eh?</font>

101
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Monkey Enma.</font>

102
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...
I knew this would happen.</font>

103
00:12:38,190 --> 00:12:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're pathetic, Sarutobi...
It's because you didn't kill him back then.</font>

104
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do it now!</font>

105
00:12:46,490 --> 00:12:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late.</font>

106
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... Enma!
The Adamantine Nyoi.</font>

107
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:59,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take care of him.
Don't let him transform into that!</font>

108
00:13:03,130 --> 00:13:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... Got it!</font>

109
00:13:14,730 --> 00:13:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

110
00:13:23,190 --> 00:13:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

111
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow... What level of Ninjutsu battle!</font>

112
00:13:35,290 --> 00:13:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Hokage level!</font>

113
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh well...
Things have finally gotten interesting.</font>

114
00:13:55,930 --> 00:13:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's one of his Snake Swords.</font>

115
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do it, Enma!</font>

116
00:14:08,610 --> 00:14:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how strong the body,
the Snake Sword still hurts.</font>

117
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine!</font>

118
00:15:16,890 --> 00:15:17,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

119
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So foolish...</font>

120
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd strike without even
using the Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

121
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it.</font>

122
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that he didn't use it.
He can't use it.</font>

123
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The amount of Chakra the Third Hokage
has differs from the past.</font>

124
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:39,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shadow Clone Jutsu that
evenly disperses Chakra,</font>

125
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if things go wrong,
would be like throwing away Chakra.</font>

126
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, is it age?!</font>

127
00:15:51,970 --> 00:15:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Sensei?</font>

128
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:57,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please hang in there.</font>

129
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are called...</font>

130
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:06,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"the Professor who knows and uses all
of the Jutsu existent in Leaf Village," right?</font>

131
00:16:07,150 --> 00:16:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't disappoint me too much.</font>

132
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please get up, Hokage-sama...!</font>

133
00:16:16,830 --> 00:16:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And please save the Leaf Village!</font>

134
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:21,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

135
00:16:23,670 --> 00:16:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool... It is too late.</font>

136
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi, what's wrong?</font>

137
00:16:39,770 --> 00:16:42,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not your usual self.</font>

138
00:16:42,770 --> 00:16:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as if you're good for nothing...
What are you hesitating for?</font>

139
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now's the time to draw the line.</font>

140
00:16:58,490 --> 00:16:59,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...</font>

141
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... fool!</font>

142
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...</font>

143
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the end.</font>

144
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll snap your neck.</font>

145
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought...</font>

146
00:18:36,470 --> 00:18:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like there's no point if
I don't do something about the soul itself</font>

147
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:42,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that is bound by the Reanimation.</font>

148
00:18:43,970 --> 00:18:49,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, all I can do is to use...
the Fourth Hokage's Jutsu.</font>

149
00:18:53,570 --> 00:19:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First Hokage-sama, Second Hokage-sama,
please forgive me for using that Jutsu!</font>

150
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei... it seems you're out of breath.</font>

151
00:19:08,910 --> 00:19:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've gotten old, haven't you?</font>

152
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:15,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen such a pained look.</font>

153
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so funny?</font>

154
00:19:23,010 --> 00:19:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's quite sad...</font>

155
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old age beats even you,
once renowned as the god of Shinobi.</font>

156
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that...?!
What the hell is going on?</font>

157
00:19:43,870 --> 00:19:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell is that youth?</font>

158
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell are you?!</font>

159
00:19:51,620 --> 00:19:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it so sudden you can't tell?</font>

160
00:19:55,460 --> 00:19:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me. Orochimaru.</font>

161
00:20:00,380 --> 00:20:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

162
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you completed that
Forbidden Jutsu?!</font>

163
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a truly frightening,
inhuman monster!</font>

164
00:20:41,170 --> 00:20:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally caught up.</font>

165
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as far as you guys go.</font>

166
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

167
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

168
00:20:54,810 --> 00:20:56,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away now.</font>

169
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

170
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

171
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

172
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

173
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

174
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

175
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

176
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

177
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

178
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

179
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

180
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

181
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

182
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

183
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

184
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

185
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

186
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

187
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

188
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

189
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

190
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

191
00:22:47,510 --> 00:22:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Orochimaru...</font>

192
00:22:49,050 --> 00:22:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">a genius Ninja who appeared
during the war-torn era</font>

193
00:22:51,050 --> 00:22:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and one of a kind in decades.</font>

194
00:22:54,180 --> 00:22:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I wanted to believe that this individual
would succeed my strength and will.</font>

195
00:23:00,190 --> 00:23:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But my naivete created this situation.</font>

196
00:23:04,820 --> 00:23:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I will bury you now and
correct my old mistake.</font>

197
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time
"The Hokage's Mistake. The True Face Under the Mask."</font>

